how it works:
.feature file
   ↓
Cucumber
   ↓
Mapping Given / When / Then
   ↓
Step Definition (.ts)
   ↓
Playwright
   ↓
Browser
   ↓
Web Application


create test cases:
step 1: create a feature file
step 2: create a cucumber.json file for configuration under project folder 
step 3: edit package.json to convert default language JS to TS
step 4: create a step file

note: 
get into cucumber extension installation page again, it shows up paths of feature files which is where we have to keep feature files.
OR
settings -> settings -> search cucumber -> select Extensions: cucumber -> Edit in settings.json -> copy Related Path of feature folder and step folder -> add to settings
